cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Telegram Chat Stats"
abstract: "CLI tool that parses Telegram Desktop HTML chat exports and generates a static HTML page with chat statistics (27 panels: reactions, edits, forwards, media weight, polls, reply speed, chronotypes, heatmap, streaks and more). No framework, no server, no database."
authors:
